OL,3,GNEWSAManslaughter arrest after man     
OL,4,Aelectrocuted in field                  
OL,6,FPolice have arrested a man on suspicion
OL,7,Fof manslaughter after another man was  
OL,8,Fkilled when he was electrocuted by a   
OL,9,Fdamaged power line in a field on       
OL,10,FSunday.                                
OL,12,FKevin Walkden, 58, died after he came  
OL,13,Finto contact with a live exposed       
OL,14,Felectricity cable near South Moor Lane 
OL,15,Fin Knottingley at about 14:00 GMT.     
OL,17,FWest Yorkshire Police said there was   
OL,18,Fnothing to suggest Walkden was involved
OL,19,Fin any attempt to interfere with, steal
OL,20,For damage the cable, and have now      
OL,21,Farrested a man in his 30s who was later
OL,22,Freleased on bail.                      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
